2026-10-08T14:39:23.7955707Z [36;1m# `main` entry point — before the executable-root elaboration runs,[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7956188Z [36;1m# and the link then dies with `ld.lld: error: undefined symbol:[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7956618Z [36;1m# main`. Seen 2026-09-09 after months of the combined command[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7957067Z [36;1m# passing; the build order in a good run is Main → Main → Main:c.o,[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7957809Z [36;1m# in the bad one Main → Main:c.o → Main.[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7958111Z [36;1mbuild_all() {[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7958353Z [36;1m  lake build FlareOperator \[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7958646Z [36;1m    && lake build flare_operator \[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7958930Z [36;1m    && lake build flare_unit \[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7959196Z [36;1m    && lake build flare_e2e[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7959438Z [36;1m}[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7959719Z [36;1m# Retry once from a CLEAN tree. The runner's clang also dies with[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7960173Z [36;1m# SIGBUS (exit 135) occasionally (two consecutive otherwise-green[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7960629Z [36;1m# runs); a plain retry would re-link whatever partial objects the[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7961072Z [36;1m# first attempt left behind and fail the same way, so wipe them.[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7961529Z [36;1m# A real compile error fails both attempts and still fails the job.[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7961897Z [36;1mbuild_all || {[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7962212Z [36;1m  echo "::warning::lake build failed — cleaning and retrying once"[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7962562Z [36;1m  lake clean[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7962772Z [36;1m  build_all[0m
2026-10-08T14:39:23.7962976Z [36;1m}[0m
