2026-10-08T14:51:39.8480935Z ok - first observation of a non-zero count is a POSSIBLY UNREPAIRED request (no longer a silent baseline)
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8481895Z ok - an increase attributes the delta
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8482264Z ok - unchanged attributes nothing
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8482779Z ok - a counter that went DOWN is a reset: the new count is all new drops
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8483352Z ok - a reset to zero (fresh master, no drops yet) attributes nothing
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8483822Z ok - a destination first seen on an INITIALIZED ledger counts fully
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8484286Z ok - counters are keyed per master: another master's first sighting also counts
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8484708Z ok - a request is recorded once per destination
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8485097Z ok - more drops on the same destination extend the entry, not duplicate it
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8485726Z ok - a destination matching a Slave resolves to its key
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8486297Z ok - an unmatched destination stays requested and unresolved
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8486874Z ok - a destination that is now a MASTER is voided, not demoted
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8488088Z ok - resolution accepts the bare host as well as host:port
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8488867Z ok - a gated request is HELD with its reason and produces no action
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8489460Z ok - a held request is not excluded from assignment (only a demoted one is)
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8489937Z ok - when the gate opens the held request becomes an action and the hold clears
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8490336Z ok - a demoted node is held out of assignment
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8490643Z ok - plan does not act twice on a demoted entry
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8491174Z ok - the mode on and following/initial_sync/disconnected/error own; needs_rebuild, idle, off and unreadable do not
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8491879Z ok - a COMPLETE reply without follower keys (tch, older flared) is NOT unreadable: not owned, ordinary repair
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8492483Z ok - at request time an unreadable follower is Unknown: neither owned nor not-owned
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8492977Z ok - holding records ownership, a visible reason, the bar and its epoch
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8493489Z ok - a later drop in the same epoch raises the bar and never lowers it; a new epoch replaces it
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8494021Z ok - an owned request is never planned for demotion while the gate is open
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8494701Z ok - a request held on an unreadable follower is not demoted either
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8495122Z ok - following at 99 keeps; following at 100 closes without a rebuild
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8495603Z ok - a BIGGER position in ANOTHER epoch does not close: it is a different number line
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8496161Z ok - a disconnected follower's position is not trusted for closing, but ownership continues
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8496756Z ok - a TRANSIENT stats failure keeps the hold and hands nothing over (no rebuild on a probe hiccup)
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8497578Z ok - after the hiccup a readable pass resumes: following past the bar closes
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8498127Z ok - needs_rebuild hands the entry to the ordinary path, keeping its drops and node key
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8498649Z ok - an owned entry with no recorded bar stays owned and is not closed by position
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8499364Z ok - ownership, bar and epoch survive the status round trip (an operator restart)
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8500183Z ok - a node still reporting the OLD version stays held
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8500799Z ok - a node reporting the demotion version is released, recording boot id, current id and drops at reseat
2026-10-08T14:51:39.8501572Z ok - unreadable stats change nothing (fail closed: stay held)
